{"unit_id":"TongaiLinC__dsh-mobile-access#card-card-zh","repo":"TongaiLinC/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"baae3fb0eb40acdf7e470430faa51182953e6198","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-access 是供 DeepSeek Harness Web GUI 使用的移动端访问插件，通过 PC 页面中的移动访问面板启动网关代理，让手机或平板经局域网或 VPN 打开同一工作区。它在宿主端注册 API 与门禁页面，并向 GUI 注入面板、扫码二维码和窄屏适配界面。用户可审批设备、查看 LAN/VPN 地址、识别访问模式，并选择阻止公网直连；代理也转发 HTTP 与 WebSocket。适合希望在移动设备继续使用 PC 上 DSH 的用户。无需 API 密钥；需运行 DSH Web GUI，手机与 PC 可通过局域网或配置好的 VPN 互通。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2010-2048"]}
{"unit_id":"TongaiLinC__dsh-mobile-access#card-card-en","repo":"TongaiLinC/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"baae3fb0eb40acdf7e470430faa51182953e6198","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mobile-access lets phones reach the DSH Web GUI over LAN or VPN. Start its gateway in the PC panel and scan a QR code to connect. It adds device approvals, network-mode display, and mobile layout fixes; it detects LAN, VPN, and WAN access and can block WAN traffic. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2010-2048"]}
