{"unit_id":"TongaiLinC__dsh-mobile-access#feature-feature-1","repo":"TongaiLinC/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"baae3fb0eb40acdf7e470430faa51182953e6198","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-access 的设备审批功能：手机首次访问时提交设备申请，PC 面板可批准、拒绝、撤销或删除设备。批准后门禁才放行该设备访问 GUI。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1895-1945"]}
{"unit_id":"TongaiLinC__dsh-mobile-access#feature-feature-2","repo":"TongaiLinC/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"baae3fb0eb40acdf7e470430faa51182953e6198","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-access 的网关代理功能：在 PC 面板启动代理并生成局域网二维码地址，代理将 HTTP 与 WebSocket 请求转发到本机 DSH Web 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1814-1830","lib/index.js:1470-1514"]}
{"unit_id":"TongaiLinC__dsh-mobile-access#feature-feature-3","repo":"TongaiLinC/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"baae3fb0eb40acdf7e470430faa51182953e6198","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-access 的网络模式识别功能：根据访问主机及网络接口信息区分局域网、VPN 与公网，并展示可用的 LAN/VPN 地址供手机连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1720-1794"]}
{"unit_id":"TongaiLinC__dsh-mobile-access#feature-feature-4","repo":"TongaiLinC/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"baae3fb0eb40acdf7e470430faa51182953e6198","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-access 的公网访问策略功能：PC 面板可切换禁止公网直连并调整代理端口，保存后服务端据此限制公网注册与门禁访问。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1100-1158","lib/index.js:1958-2004"]}
{"unit_id":"TongaiLinC__dsh-mobile-access#feature-feature-5","repo":"TongaiLinC/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"baae3fb0eb40acdf7e470430faa51182953e6198","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-access 的窄屏界面适配功能：注入的浏览器脚本调整移动端界面布局，并处理窄屏下的第三方皮肤显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:300-450","lib/index.js:900-1045"]}
{"unit_id":"TongaiLinC__dsh-mobile-access#caveat-caveat-1","repo":"TongaiLinC/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"baae3fb0eb40acdf7e470430faa51182953e6198","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-access 使用前须知：启动网关会在 0.0.0.0 上开放可配置端口（默认 3081），设备和策略状态写入 DSH_HOME 下的 dsh-mobile/state.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1532-1540","lib/index.js:1660-1668","lib/index.js:1814-1828"]}
